{"seq":2,"slug":"education-and-mentor","title":"求学与恩师","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/education-and-mentor","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graham-and-columbia","title":"格雷厄姆与哥伦比亚","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/education-and-mentor/graham-and-columbia","wordCount":1425,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"value-investing-roots","title":"价值投资的根基","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/education-and-mentor/value-investing-roots","wordCount":1498,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 求学与恩师\n\n巴菲特投资思想的系统根基，源自他在哥伦比亚大学师从格雷厄姆的经历。本章揭示这一思想渊源。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"格雷厄姆与哥伦比亚\"——这位价值投资之父如何为巴菲特的投资直觉注入严密的理论框架。第二篇文档讲述\"价值投资的根基\",剖析这一塑造了他一生的核心理念。\n"}